{"kind": "short", "title": "Cold Open \u2013 A Blink of Green at the Horizon", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.84, "label": "", "text": "A green ray can shoot up from the setting sun."}, {"start": 3.06, "end": 5.21, "label": "", "text": "It lasts less than two seconds."}, {"start": 5.43, "end": 6.97, "label": "", "text": "You have probably missed it."}, {"start": 7.19, "end": 7.87, "label": "", "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 8.09, "end": 9.33, "label": "", "text": "It is too fast."}, {"start": 9.55, "end": 11.38, "label": "", "text": "The sky splits into colors."}, {"start": 11.6, "end": 13.29, "label": "", "text": "A green spot appears."}, {"start": 13.51, "end": 15.24, "label": "", "text": "It hovers above the sun."}, {"start": 15.46, "end": 16.82, "label": "", "text": "Then it vanishes."}, {"start": 17.04, "end": 18.3, "label": "", "text": "It is not a trick."}, {"start": 18.52, "end": 20.72, "label": "", "text": "The atmosphere acts like a prism."}, {"start": 20.94, "end": 24.27, "label": "", "text": "It bends sunlight via wavelength-varying refraction."}, {"start": 24.49, "end": 26.04, "label": "", "text": "Blue light scatters away."}, {"start": 26.26, "end": 27.86, "label": "", "text": "Green light remains."}, {"start": 28.08, "end": 29.51, "label": "", "text": "You see a brief flash."}, {"start": 29.73, "end": 31.48, "label": "", "text": "It is a tiny green spot."}, {"start": 31.7, "end": 33.43, "label": "", "text": "It sits on the horizon."}, {"start": 33.65, "end": 35.61, "label": "", "text": "You need clear, stable air."}, {"start": 35.83, "end": 37.28, "label": "", "text": "Pilots see it often."}, {"start": 37.5, "end": 38.93, "label": "", "text": "They fly westward."}, {"start": 39.15, "end": 41.03, "label": "", "text": "They watch the sunset slowly."}, {"start": 41.25, "end": 42.81, "label": "", "text": "They see the green flash."}, {"start": 43.03, "end": 44.37, "label": "", "text": "That is the flash."}], "engage_kind": "request", "question": "Which 